        "solution": "num = int('100')\nnum_float = float(num)\nnum_str = str(num_float)\nprint(num, type(num))\nprint(num_float, type(num_float))\nprint(num_str, type(num_str))",
        "hint": "int() converts to integer, float() to float, str() to string.",
